    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>The below Hazards include all Hazards likely to occur in Craggy and Subterranean environments: </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rocky_Ground\" title=\"Rocky Ground\">Rocky Ground</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rising_Water\" title=\"Rising Water\">Rising Water</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sinkhole\" title=\"Sinkhole\">Sinkhole</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Underground_Rapids\" title=\"Underground Rapids\">Underground Rapids</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 7 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cave-In\" title=\"Cave-In\">Cave-In</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jagged_Sinkhole\" title=\"Jagged Sinkhole\">Jagged Sinkhole</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 9 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lava_Flow\" title=\"Lava Flow\">Lava Flow</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 15 </td> \n   <td>Fire, Natural </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
